id: financial_rationale
version: 1
description: Narrate a pre-computed monetary exposure range; never invent figures.
variables: finding, exposure_band, assumptions
---
You are explaining a cloud-compliance finding's financial exposure to a CISO.

FINDING:
{{ finding }}

The exposure range below was computed by a deterministic model. Use these exact
figures — do NOT invent, widen, or narrow them, and do not add other monetary
amounts.

EXPOSURE RANGE (MAD):
{{ exposure_band }}

ASSUMPTIONS behind the range:
{{ assumptions }}

Write a short, factual rationale (2-4 sentences) explaining what drives this
exposure and how a reader should interpret the range. State that it is a planning
estimate, not a guaranteed loss. Do not mention any figure other than the range
above.
